This level is solved using 'grep' which used as a tool to
search for specific words, phrases, or text patterns.

There are two ways to solve this:

I. Extract file contents and grep upon it:

    this method would first get the contents of a file pipe(|) into grep with the  keyword that
    is to be searched.

    COMMAND: cat data.txt | grep millionth

II. Direct use of grep to get password:

    This method is the most efficient way as grep can get content of file and passing the search 
    parameter with the file refernce is the most effective way to solve this level.

    COMMAND: grep millionth data.txt
